<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield at 6.15 per cent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield at 6.15 per cent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus central bank on Wednesday said the yield at a reverse repo auction of 14-day treasury bills was 6.15 percent, up 0.03 points from the average yield on September 11.</p>
<p>Commerical banks under-subscribed the tender by making bids for bills worth 6.5 million pounds. The central bank invited tenders for bills worth 10 million pounds.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
